 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ahab is gone and Moab rebels against the throne",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ahaziah falls through the lattice in his upper room",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Injured and ill he sends word out to the coast",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go ask Baal-Zebub the god of Ekron about the hope",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is there no God in Israel that you must go ask",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The god of Ekron for a sign and a task",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will not get up from the bed you are lying on",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will surely die as the Lord has spoken",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The angel of the Lord speaks to Elijah the Tishbite",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go meet the messengers of the king of Samaria",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask them why they seek a foreign idol's word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the Lord of Hosts is right here in the land",
   "heard": 11,
